1
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:21,550
One scan. One explainable cryptographic inventory.

2
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:28,992
A signing call goes to ML-DSA-65.

3
00:00:28,992 --> 00:00:37,463
A wrapped key goes to a hybrid key exchange.

4
00:00:37,463 --> 00:00:47,550
A cipher list that never says what for gets no target.

5
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:55,358
Open the finding: where it is, what it does,

6
00:00:55,358 --> 00:01:02,550
how sure the evidence is — and what it costs.

7
00:01:03,300 --> 00:01:10,262
A remediation programme. A report a director can read.

8
00:01:10,262 --> 00:01:15,550
A CBOM that passes the official schema.
